        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LKE150FAL, 1-1/2\" Diameter Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wooden Offset Door Pull is from First Impression's Lewis Collection which features <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\" target=\"new\">your choice of wood</a> for the handle and beautiful finishes for the brackets. Choose from cherry, mahogany, white oak, black walnut, and teak. The LKE150FAL Offset Wood Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Lewis Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LWS03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262321\"><b>First Impressions LKE150FAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LKE150018FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.84\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150024FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.84\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150036FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.84\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wooden Offset Door Pull",
                "description": "The Wooden Offset Door Pull is from First Impression's Lewis Collection which features your choice of wood for the handle and beautiful finishes for the brackets. Choose from cherry, mahogany, white oak, black walnut, and teak. The LKE150FAL Offset Wood Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. This door handle can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to back mounted. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Offset Wood Pulls, Wooden Offset Door Pulls, First Impressions LWS03,  First Impressions L2-TEAK-OFFSET FII-L2-TEAK-OFFSET, First Impressions LWS03018 18 inch door pulls, First Impressions LWS03024 24 inch door pulls, First Impressions LWS03036 36 inch door pulls, FII-LWS03, 1-1/2 Diameter Offset Door Pulls, First Impressions Lewis 03 Wood Door Handles, FII-LKE150FAL, First Impressions LKE150FAL, First Impressions lake 150 door pulls,"
